## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Hişyarî: Scripta bêbersiv
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = Dibe ku scripteke li ser vê rûpelê mijûl be, an jî hatibe rawestandin. Dikarî niha rawestînî an jî bidomînî ka dê script biqede an na..
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Pirtûkxane: { $location }
